# Token-Optimized Development

Start narrow. Read `CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/COMMON_MISTAKES.md`, `.claude/QUICK_START.md`, `.claude/ARCHITECTURE_MAP.md`.

Use `docs/INDEX.md` to select task-specific docs. Do not auto-load `.claude/completions/**`, `.claude/sessions/**`, `docs/archive/**`, build outputs, or generated graph data.

Before reading large files or many files, use Code Review Graph if available:

- Build graph: `/code-review-graph:build-graph`
- Review current changes: `/code-review-graph:review-delta`
- Review PR: `/code-review-graph:review-pr`

If slash commands are unavailable, run or ask user to run:

```bash
code-review-graph build
code-review-graph status
code-review-graph update
```

Prefer `rg` and symbol queries over full-file reads. Summarize long terminal output.
